<<SetCharacterExpression "Aryan" "Skeptical">>
Aryan: Well played.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: Thanks.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Aryan" "Smiling">>
Aryan: you have some good shots.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: Thanks.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Aryan" "Astonished">>
Aryan: You also have a steady hand. I am surprised.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: Thanks.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Serious">>
Ramu: Raju, talk to him properly. Dont be rude.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Angry">>
Raju: But Bhaiyya, he tormented me and called me names before the match.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Calmlyexplaining">>
Ramu: It's fine—don't hold a grudge, these are small things that aren't important.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Aryan" "Furious">>
Aryan: Don't be cocky slum boys—just luck. Next time we'll eat you for breakfast.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Proud">>
Ramu: Yes we are poor, but we have our manners.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Aryan" "Proud">>
Aryan: Older brother to the rescue—slum boy can't fight his own battles.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Smiling">>
Ramu: Yes, I am his shadow and he is my source—we thank you for the compliments.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: Thanks.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Aryan" "Disgusted">>
Aryan: I hope not. Cant take your beggar face anymore.

